==Battleground==
*1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns.
*1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[I.M. Phace]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Imperator Sael]] spawns.
**5 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 15~30 seconds<sup>450f~900f</sup>.
**12 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is recommended to have at least gotten all [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] up to [[The Great Abyss (Into the Future)|The Great Abyss]] Ch.1 at this point. Treat this stage like you would The Great Abyss. If you're doing this stage later on, bring anything.

